From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:31:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: Warn, not err, about an interface the MXXMLWriter has
 not got.

PowerPoint asks the writer for {e19c7100-9709-4db7-9373-e7b518b47086},
which MXXMLWriter60 answers with E_NOINTERFACE on Windows 11 too, as do
the SAX reader and the DOM document (tools/startupgapsprobe oledead).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/msxml3/mxwriter.c b/dlls/msxml3/mxwriter.c
index 536df680cb6..f3c8b121a2b 100644
--- a/dlls/msxml3/mxwriter.c
+++ b/dlls/msxml3/mxwriter.c
@@ -882,7 +882,7 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI mxwriter_QueryInterface(IMXWriter *iface, REFIID riid, voi
     }
     else
     {
-        ERR("interface %s not implemented\n", debugstr_guid(riid));
+        WARN("interface %s not implemented\n", debugstr_guid(riid));
         *obj = NULL;
         return E_NOINTERFACE;
     }
